[CASE wifi_connect]
[Kc6probe net
rpc: skipping SetConfig, using slave's stored config
rpc: WifiConnect tx pb=10 tlv=22
rpc: WifiConnect pb bytes: 08 01 10 9a 02 18 06 d2 11 00
rpc: WifiConnect resp=0
c6probe: network init ret=0
nsh> 
